WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.020
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.740
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.510
Mountains are calling

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.470
The sky is calling

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:27.980
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:34.360
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:42.490
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:44.830
Run and Run!

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.790
Run and Run!

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.370
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:57.090
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:04.890
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:08.100
That's right!     It is young

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:15.110
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:29.300
<i>In the middle of the storm,
the last attack has begun.</i>

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:36.640
<i>Silver's squad, attacked the first
fort, which Madara was commanding.</i>

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.730
<i>Madara's counterattack
became worse than expected.</i>

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:02.710
<i>Ben, who followed the leader to the
back of the pass, is attacked by Sniper-</i>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.760
<i>- and pulls him down the crevice.</i>

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:27.490
SORROW<i>!</i>
BENIZAKURA'S LAST MOMENTS

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.410
Three at a once! he can't handle it!

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.920
Take his legs! Stop him!

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.570
Good! He stopped!
A little more!

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.360
You bastard! Fall then!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.120
Beware, Silver!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.240
You'll crash with the tree!

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.210
What a destructive force!

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.550
<i>It's useless... We can't beat Madara!</i>

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.050
<i>Can't beat him...</i>

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.700
<i>If this goes on,
we'll only lose more of our allies.</i>

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.060
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:37.920
Si...

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:38.800
Sickle...

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.570
Kirikaze! What is it?

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:46.270
Master... If we had a sickle... we could...

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.420
Sickle?

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.820
Koga ninja leader, Kurojaki's weapon!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.320
There are sickles on the farms...

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:59.310
But we don't have the time to go there now.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.590
<i>That!</i>

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.840
Moss! Come on, Moss!

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.800
Oh what?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.050
Can you break off this branch?

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.050
I don't know for what, but if it's
muscles you need, leave it to me!

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.480
What are you going to do with it, Silver?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.070
That good enough?

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.070
Thank you, Moss.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.530
Kirikaze! We'll beat Madara with this!

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.240
Mr. Akame!

00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:36.740
I understand! Come then!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.770
Look over there!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:06.270
Silver, we only have one chance!
If we miss, we are dead!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.270
I know.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:15.870
Now!

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:16.660
Here we go!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.750
Wrong, Madara! I'm just a decoy!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.420
Madara, get ready!

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:35.680
Alright!

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:44.560
He's stubborn...

00:05:56.240 --> 00:05:57.410
Silver! Beware!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.790
<i>What a horrible one!
Is he immortal?</i>

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:17.510
Watch out!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:28.980
Beware, run!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.930
It worked... We did it!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.680
Victory! We took down the first fort!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.980
Kirikaze! Can you hear it?

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.530
Kirikaze! We have avenged you.

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:16.240
Thank you, Silver.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:20.260
Master... I'll go in advance.
Please forgive me.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.240
Kirikaze, this is just a scratch...

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:24.620
Kirikaze!

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.620
Kirikaze...

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:38.130
You fought bravely.
Like a true ninja dog from Iga.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:49.860
That's?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:53.360
It's the brothers from Kai.
Seems they have taken the second fort!

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.650
The Kai's are good.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.610
From the west aswell...

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:11.000
John and the others
took the fourth fort!

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.920
We shouldn't be resting.
Attack with everything we have!

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:14.670
Yes!

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.960
Hakuro! Call everyone here!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:17.920
Okay!

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:33.020
What is it, Hakuro?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.280
Why do we gather?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:39.530
Silver's orders.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:40.780
Silver's?

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:47.580
I want you all to follow my
command from now on!

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.830
What do you mean, Silver?

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:55.840
Attacking one by one is just like shooting
single arrows at a huge castle.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:09:00.040
If we all attack at once,
the power is several times higher!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.600
That's the only way to
attack Akakabuto's castle!

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:09.810
Follow me!

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:16.480
Benizakura, what is it?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.030
I trust in you.
Do as you want.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.780
I will follow you.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.240
Me too! Silver, you give the orders!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.490
Do it, Silver!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.230
Silver...
Of course, i have no objection!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.000
(All) Me too!

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:39.790
<i>At Silver's command, a new
attack force was formed.</i>

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.560
<i>The Leader, who climbed along
the back of the mountain-</i>

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:53.060
<i>- was approaching the castle,
where Akakabuto resided.</i>

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:58.900
<i>He is... I can't see him, but he is there.</i>

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.370
<i>He's waiting for me to jump up.</i>

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:08.410
<i>If I use the wind, I can jump
over and get behind him.</i>

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:11.750
<i>I have to bet on it!</i>

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.970
There you are, Akakabuto!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.680
<i>Wind, blow!
Please raise me higher!</i>

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.680
<i>The Leader got into Akakabuto's castle alone.</i>

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.170
<i>Is there even any chance of success?</i>

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:22.610
<i>Or was it with suicide attack in the mind?</i>

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.530
<i>For hundreds of years of the Bear dogs-</i>

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.280
<i>- a mysterious technique has been
handed down in generations.</i>

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:31.780
<i>I will show it now!</i>

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.010
<i>It happened in an instant.</i>

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:49.760
<i>The leader disappeared in a flash of light
from Akakabuto's perspective.</i>

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:55.480
<i>The moment he disappeared, three fingers
were cleanly cut off, by The Leader's sharp fangs.</i>

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.770
<i>But... The Leader was not unharmed.</i>

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:03.770
<i>To slow down the
staggering speed-</i>

00:12:03.810 --> 00:12:06.770
<i>- he had to throw himself against a tree.</i>

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:12.520
<i>The impact makes breathing difficult,
and paralyzes the whole body for a moment.</i>

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.880
<i>The technique used up all
his physical strength.</i>

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:18.700
Hmm?

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:39.230
<i>The Leader was surprised by the attack from behind,
and was buried alive in the cracks on the bedrock.</i>

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:48.820
<i>The one whom The Leader believed was
Akakabuto, was actually his double, Gaki.</i>

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:54.820
<i>The giant bear that just appeared at the
top of the mountain, was the real Akakabuto.</i>

00:12:55.280 --> 00:13:00.570
<i>The brain damage has caused his body
to grow abnormally gigantic.</i>

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.000
<i>He was indeed worthy
to be called "The Demon King"</i>

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.830
Strange! I can't see them!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.060
More than half should still be left.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.330
Be careful!

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:21.810
Oh?

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:23.310
What's that?

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.310
Maybe it's a trap?

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:29.480
A trap?

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.360
Wait here.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.820
I see nothing, but it smells like bear.

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.470
Their territory! Of course it stinks!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.370
Let's move forward anyway.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.430
Okay!

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:51.350
What?
I thought the ground was moving.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.090
The ground is soft.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.360
<i>It's Mosa!</i>

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.030
Silver! Beware!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.080
Make a formation for each unit
and surround them!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:23.620
<i>The bears did not give the dogs a
chance to organize themselves-</i>

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.580
<i>- by doing a preemptive attack.</i>

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.930
Silver is in danger!
Protect Silver!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:50.270
He's just chasing after Silver!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:52.520
I see! You're gonna kill
the commander first!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:53.690
You son of a bitch!

00:15:05.740 --> 00:15:07.470
Who's there?
Show youself!

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:09.670
Oh, that voice...

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:12.170
That voice is?

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:13.920
It's me.

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.670
So it's Ben!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.600
Wait!
I'll be your opponent!

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:27.640
No, Benizakura!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:31.230
It's not the type of opponent
you can fight one on one!

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:00.840
Unbelievable! You are certainly
the strongest male in the world!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.550
That was beautiful!
You killed him!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.850
Moss! Watch out!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.660
Benizakura!

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:26.240
Forgive me, Benizakura!
You did for me...

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.750
No, Benizakura!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.700
Take care of the wounds first!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:35.500
Don't interfere!
I'll take him on, alone!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:53.310
Ben! Leave it to me!
You're weakened!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:17:00.320
Silver, Remember this... A soldier must never
show weakness infront of an enemy.

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:04.570
Even if you're facing death, you must
not break your steadfast posture.

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:08.570
Your willpower determines life or death!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:15.830
<i>Ben's defiant stance intimidated Moss.</i>

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:19.970
<i>You could see that Mosa
did not dare to move.</i>

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.970
Oh yeah!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:24.470
That!

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.230
I see! I understand!

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.070
Watch out!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:01.650
Silver!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.920
Silver, are you okay?

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:05.180
Silver! Respond!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:06.680
Mr. Akame!

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:08.680
I'm fine.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.430
Please go after Mosa!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.190
This time, I'll settle this!

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.190
Benizakura! I'll help!

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:19.700
Don't care for me!
Benizakura! I'll help!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.170
Don't care for me!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:21.650
Help Silver instead.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:22.940
Silver?

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:26.950
Only you can lift those
beams from that hut.

00:18:26.980 --> 00:18:30.450
Okay, Benizakura!
Don't die on me now.

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:39.460
Before I die, leaving some guidance
for the next generation of dogs.

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:42.720
That's the mission of us older dogs!

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:49.470
Benizakura!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.980
<i>He could defeat a Fighting Bull
with a single blow.</i>

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:58.220
<i>For Benizakura, it's not
impossible to defeat Mosa.</i>

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:05.220
<i>But now that he was severely wounded,
and the only way was to risk his own life.</i>

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.200
Damn!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:23.460
Silver... now!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:25.470
Ben! Hurry up!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.970
Was Ben there?

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:28.840
Ben!

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.100
What are you doing here?

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:31.470
Where's Mosa?

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:34.470
Benizakura pulled him
down into the lake.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:35.970
What?

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.150
Benizakura!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:39.900
Silver...

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.120
<i>Benizakura...</i>

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.410
Silver!

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.410
<i>Benizakura... Where are you?</i>

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:16.690
<i>There!</i>

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.190
<i>Silver, what are you doing here?
Don't come here!</i>

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:22.190
<i>What is it, Benizakura?</i>

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.310
<i>Benizakura's back paw...!</i>

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:34.670
<i>If you cut off the rope,
Mosa will escape!</i>

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:36.960
What does he mean...

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:39.710
Ignore me and swim back!

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:42.630
<i>Ah... No more!</i>

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:44.720
<i>I can't hold it anymore!</i>

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:45.630
<i>Me too...</i>

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:49.630
<i>I will not go back,
I'll take you home!</i>

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.050
<i>Goodbye, Silver...</i>

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.770
<i>Become a respectable male!</i>

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:05.770
Mosa is dead!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.810
Really?
Benizakura, then?

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:10.840
He got stuck in the rope down there!

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:12.160
What?

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.660
Silver? What happened to silver?

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.160
He stayed with Benizakura!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:23.420
Silver!

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:24.960
Silver!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:26.460
Silver, pull yourself together!

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:27.960
Hurry, pull him up!

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.640
I'm glad you are okay!

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:35.340
Benizakura, then?

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:38.560
Benizakura...

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:49.310
Sorry, Benizakura...

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.070
What's that?

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:10.390
Look, a cherry flower!

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:14.800
The life of Benizakura's has bloomed!
A cherry blossom in blood...

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:15.840
<i>Benizakura's...</i>

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:18.270
<i>Cherry blossom of blood!</i>

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:23.600
<i>Benizakura...</i>

00:22:34.030 --> 00:22:36.330
<i>The strongest male in the
history of fighting dogs.</i>

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:38.620
<i>The undefeated Yokozuna, Benizakura.</i>

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:40.370
<i>This is how he passed away.</i>

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:44.620
<i>But his end was too sad.</i>

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:47.790
<i>Suitable to his name "Benizakura"-</i>

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:52.290
<i>- the water surface was covered by
a giant cherry blossom of blood.</i>

00:22:52.790 --> 00:22:55.790
<i>It was the end of
his eventful life.</i>

00:22:56.850 --> 00:23:00.850
To be continued...

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:20.280
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:26.410
bathes you gently

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:32.550
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:41.110
let it flow away

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:47.110
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:53.740
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:59.920
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:05.800
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
